flowchart TD
    A[Load baseline and candidate snapshots] --> B{Versions and cases valid?}
    B -- No --> C[Reject malformed comparison]
    B -- Yes --> D[Match cases by stable case ID]
    D --> E[Compare permission and approval fields]
    E --> F[Classify outcome, validity, reason and coverage changes]
    F --> G[Assign illustrative risk labels]
    G --> H[Produce explainable impact report]
    H --> I{Any HIGH-risk changes?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Human review before release]
    I -- No --> K[Review report and regression coverage]
    J --> L[No automatic deployment or execution]
    K --> L
